# novadeck: enable the power-policy daemon (performance profiles, GPU level, fan curve) on release.
# /etc/machine-id is empty on a fresh image so systemd runs preset-all on first boot, where the stock
# 99-default.preset is "disable *"; this higher-priority preset (60 < 99) keeps it enabled. A
# build-time multi-user.target.wants symlink ships alongside as a fallback (cf.
# 60-novadeck-powerbuttond.preset).
# novadeck-powerd owns the fan, so it must run from boot even before SteamUI touches a slider.
enable novadeck-powerd.service
